Name:Rules pilot 350 - Anger works from the graveyard
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control a tapped Mountain and have Anger, Hill Giant and Faithless Looting in hand, with five red mana floating. Your library is three Colossal Dreadmaws. The opponent is at 3 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-graveyard-static-anger | An ability works only on the battlefield unless it says otherwise (CR 113.6), and Anger's says it works from your graveyard (CR 113.6b): discard Anger to Faithless Looting and the Hill Giant you cast has haste while you control a Mountain, attacking for 3; casting Anger itself gives only a 2-power attacker
